  <item>
    <title>09  冲绳胃战日记：烤肉放题暴风吸入与奶茶续命玄学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680b83278aed253fa382cc22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680b83278aed253fa382cc22</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Apr 2025 12:57:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 烤肉店の社死初体验</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝首战日本烤肉店：误把取号机当点单机，被台湾同胞当店员使唤。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>发现“自助烤肉=自己动手饿肚子”真相，靠偷瞄邻桌解锁点单技能。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>评分环节：烤肉咸到怀疑人生，贝贝怒吼：“三星，不能再多了！”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 海鲜市场与“毒枭西装”の奇幻联动</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>赤岭站海鲜市场暴风吸入：70元刺身拼盘让上海物价党集体破防。 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://cps.dianping.com/shop/G91lVQYc9lFk2JZm?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=HkTC8RTAZj_1744353646&amp;requestCode=13c70cb4eff048b48d86e8d1127169b8&amp;responseCode=c7f80805138248d091a74019c831d6bf&amp;fromJS=1&amp;isCpsRedir=true&amp;code=041LlZZv3BwBN43mR23w3rwgrj0LlZZg&amp;state=" data-url="https://cps.dianping.com/shop/G91lVQYc9lFk2JZm?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=HkTC8RTAZj_1744353646&amp;requestCode=13c70cb4eff048b48d86e8d1127169b8&amp;responseCode=c7f80805138248d091a74019c831d6bf&amp;fromJS=1&amp;isCpsRedir=true&amp;code=041LlZZv3BwBN43mR23w3rwgrj0LlZZg&amp;state="><span>魚屋直営食堂 魚まる</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>古着店抓马：皮特试穿昭和西装，口袋惊现“神秘白粉”笑翻全场。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝锐评：“冲绳特产雪花牛肉浪？包邮吗亲？”</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/67e27eb3000000000603e220?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CBVx3yLQdk00skuaS_701RKo8AjZRr0vLHC0Uv4KmWKO0=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591330&amp;share_id=95bb04d915a249b08b3764496fbf66c4&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/67e27eb3000000000603e220?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CBVx3yLQdk00skuaS_701RKo8AjZRr0vLHC0Uv4KmWKO0=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591330&amp;share_id=95bb04d915a249b08b3764496fbf66c4&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>濑长岛美食攻略</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 秘鲁菜の跨服聊天与奶茶の尊严</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>南米料理店上演《语言の壁》：120急救车 vs 120路公交，全员鸡同鸭讲。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbI7SfikAyP0RVZTU6atz8mvK7c.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>秘鲁烤鸡柴到怀疑鸡生，贝贝怒掏腰痛贴：“薄荷味烤肉，这很冲绳。”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>夜宵环节：贝贝狂炫麻辣烫+奶茶，高呼“老中人の胃永不屈服！”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>AO Cafe</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkubys2b4t20-d-nVh-StjPjhW7z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 咖啡店拖延战与便利店の神级操作</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>甜品店苦等慕斯蛋糕20分钟，贝贝朋友圈怒吼：“队友疑似被蛋糕绑架！”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>全家便利店硬核早餐：泡面汤泡饭被吐槽“《中华小当家》暗黑番外”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>牛奶布丁玄学：林国雄称“日本便利店之光”，皮特冷笑：“不如东北大板。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 美国村の文艺诈骗与机场墨镜の孽缘</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>港川外人住宅区：台湾同胞扎堆香水店，贝贝闻完翻白眼：“不如夜市9.9包邮。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/663a0f12000000001e01fe0c?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CBfNpCiGJ_SMY35mfofRt0K-oVOmoD96I4FR99pEaYT-k=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591438&amp;share_id=66f5becc825f444ca9e6d7a7883019a1&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/663a0f12000000001e01fe0c?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CBfNpCiGJ_SMY35mfofRt0K-oVOmoD96I4FR99pEaYT-k=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591438&amp;share_id=66f5becc825f444ca9e6d7a7883019a1&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>美国村咖啡</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/67ee6450000000001d0059fd?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CB2Uh4rtgv901LYmNXlJ7Xfu5hypn1DBo-Xrys7CSa18M=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591466&amp;share_id=3933ea3b966b4f04affce9719fe26584&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/67ee6450000000001d0059fd?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=8.80&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;type=normal&amp;xsec_token=CB2Uh4rtgv901LYmNXlJ7Xfu5hypn1DBo-Xrys7CSa18M=&amp;author_share=1&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;shareRedId=N0c0RTtGOz9KSTdHPzgxPDZJOko2ODhN&amp;apptime=1745591466&amp;share_id=3933ea3b966b4f04affce9719fe26584&amp;wechatWid=483ec8aa94c8658b5f741558bf046119&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>大嘴鸟咖啡</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Parco city 亲子丼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6iewT84uubN4lvY7tYyWxyzqH3.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>机场免税店终极抓马：林国雄为凑8折强买墨镜，贝贝吐槽：“这镜片镶金了？”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>登机前广播神助攻：“延误半小时？这是老天逼我消费！”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a>-结尾 冲绳の胃与灵魂の总结</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝锐评：“阿古猪锅不如六婆辣椒面，但免费电影海报真香！”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-mwnqTLIE5q9zhLSCg2u9TvfXZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>林国雄购物宣言：“钱只是换成了丑墨镜陪我看世界。”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>爆笑灵魂台词：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝对烤肉店员：“Excuse me？International the night能换烤网吗？”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>皮特试吃秘鲁可乐：“这味道像崂山白花蛇草水の远方表亲！”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>林国雄机场怒吼：“这墨镜写着我的名字！不买不是中国人！”</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
