  <item>
    <title>08  冲绳疯妃团：购物狂与悬崖爆笑奇遇记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fd081702b3afa0dd659b35</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fd081702b3afa0dd659b35</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 13:14:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 开场与咖啡厅奇遇</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>三人抵达冲绳，疲惫中开启播客录制。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>咖啡厅排队“舆论战”成功前进，吐槽牙买加蓝山咖啡价格争议。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝首次出国旅行感慨。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 残波岬与万座毛：悬崖惊魂与人生照片</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>残波岬近距离观浪，贝贝恐高却硬核出片。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FihaDCRp3HkvJwooNwPcvNUJ-Qul.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>万座毛的冷风与琉球服体验：贝贝化身“冷宫疯妃”，衣服被植物勾住的爆笑插曲。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpLZV1wbSBriVIZl5azKS6C0ySPF.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>自然景观描述（浪花如“雪花牛肉”）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrcVDirgWufqUai95x6TCfxyIXN7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 交通大作战与购物狂魔林国雄</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>打车超载惊魂：司机破例载5人，比公交更便宜。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>林国雄购物战绩：落地3小时花2000元、古着店“毒枭西装”乌龙、被店员赶出店的抓马经历。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贝贝吐槽：“人类怎么会忘记自己买了什么？”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 美食与甜品的诱惑</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>烤肉店与锅子店：本地猪肉锅的独特香味，120急救车与公交车的跨服聊天。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>甜品店拖延战：为慕斯蛋糕苦等20分钟，贝贝在大堂翻白眼。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 恩纳村大风中硬核打卡</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>顶着八级寒风拍秋千照，Tolo脱衣凹造型。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>咖啡店海景与“新疆卖馕”造型自嘲。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a>-结尾 旅程总结与下期预告</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>皮特吐槽“满腔热血却买不到东西”，贝贝被同事催工。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>预告上海录制第二期：必逛景点与餐厅推荐。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>附上一个最美日落。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgfr-Z1hg61WZCO2EEZDcR0e_gKH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/677cf510634a9f2b1f1938db/lk2DLYGU4IXiO2eHYP0UuEwyfIuV.m4a" length="77925063" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvsoMYYlQULGRkF_NdhKmGXOr1Fs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
